0 Turnwise — one-motor steering geometry bench
0 Name: turnwise.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 !LICENSE Redistributable under the BSD-3-Clause license; see ../licenses/turnwise.txt.
0 // Original native arrangement. One motor on hub port A.
0 // Kingpin spacing200 LDU; arm inset40/depth80; tie rod120 LDU.
0 // Two real bearings per kingpin; both wheels rotate freely above the floor.
0 // Bounded steering experiment, not a continuous-rotation or driving program.
0 // External part meshes are referenced, not embedded. Connect motor cable to hub A.
